    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>When you slip free from your opponent, you can deliver a parting attack.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Acrobatics\" title=\"Acrobatics\">Acrobatics</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you successfully use <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Acrobatics\" title=\"Acrobatics\">Acrobatics</a> to escape a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a>, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> to make a single attack with a melee weapon or an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed\">Unarmed</a> attack against the opponent that had <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grappled\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grappled\">Grappled</a> you. If the attack hits, it deals normal damage, and your opponent is considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flat-Footed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flat-Footed\">Flat-Footed</a> until the start of its next turn.</p>",
